// Chess Ascent site settings.
// 1. Copy this file and name the copy  chess-ascent-config.js
// 2. Paste your OAuth client ID from Google Cloud Console (APIs & Services > Credentials > OAuth 2.0 Client IDs).
//    It ends with .apps.googleusercontent.com. Never put the client SECRET here: the app does not need it.
// 3. Upload chess-ascent-config.js next to chess-ascent.html on your website.
